      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大概是长期待在医院，\n已经习惯了有益于身体吸收的味道。\n所以自己做料理时也会变成那个味道──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f096e054448e37b3d472974eda38bf0664456a924387a62a61b690c8fa01e718",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071101.json",
      "json_path": [
