      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "姐姐以前也曾经取笑过我，\n说“你做的菜很像我以前\n在医院吃的病人餐”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c1eb063bda6389b14e680457d18622ffe900bed9fd681c2837bafd9f46051f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071101.json",
      "json_path": [
